                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The price for this software really needs to be reduced or even offered for free. This is not a quality VR experience at all. The performance is absolutely atrocious because the max frame rate seems to be locked at 45 fps with an extremely high reprojection rate. Using the flashlight causes shadow flickering and drops the frame rate even further down into the 30s. This happened to me using an RTX2080 and an i9 processor. There are also no graphical settings. Another thing is that you are placed lower than the virtual floor and there is no way to adjust the height. As far as the experience, there are only eight caves where you just stand around listening to a brief historical background for each one. Overall, I cannot recommend this VR software at all.",
